I wake up in the morning.
I get up from the bed.
I go near the window.
I pull back the curtain.
Suddenly, a bright light comes in.
The sunlight is very intense.
I close my eyes slightly.
Then I look outside.
There is not even a single cloud in the sky.
The sky is blue.
Today there is bright sunshine.
It is very hot in Mumbai now.
It quickly becomes hot in my room too.
I feel the heat.
Today is certainly a hot day.
Now I want some coffee.
